---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '@/config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description={`Terms and Conditions for using the ${siteConfig.name} website.`}
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="gradient-hero py-20 md:py-24 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="container relative">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-6">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/60">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a></li>
          <li><span class="mx-1">/</span></li>
          <li class="text-white font-medium">Terms & Conditions</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Terms & Conditions</h1>
      <p class="text-white/70">Last updated: January 1, 2025</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bg-white">
    <div class="container container-sm">
      <div class="prose max-w-none">
        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing and using the website of M.P. Public School, Indore ("we," "us," or "our"), you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and provision of this agreement. In addition, when using these particular services, you shall be subject to any posted guidelines or rules applicable to such services.</p>

        <h2>2. Use of Website</h2>
        <p>You agree to use this website only for lawful purposes and in a manner that does not infringe the rights of, restrict, or inhibit anyone else's use and enjoyment of the website. Prohibited behavior includes harassing or causing distress or inconvenience to any other user, transmitting obscene or offensive content, or disrupting the normal flow of dialogue within our website.</p>

        <h2>3. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All content included on this site, such as text, graphics, logos, button icons, images, audio clips, digital downloads, data compilations, and software, is the property of M.P. Public School or its content suppliers and protected by international copyright laws. The compilation of all content on this site is the exclusive property of M.P. Public School, with copyright authorship for this collection by M.P. Public School, and protected by international copyright laws.</p>

        <h2>4. Disclaimer of Warranties and Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>This site is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. No representations or warranties of any kind are made, express or implied, as to the operation of this site or the information, content, materials, or products included on this site. You expressly agree that your use of this site is at your sole risk.</p>
        <p>To the full extent permissible by applicable law, we disclaim all warranties, express or implied, including, but not limited to, implied warranties of merchantability and fitness for a particular purpose. We will not be liable for any damages of any kind arising from the use of this site, including, but not limited to direct, indirect, incidental, punitive, and consequential damages.</p>

        <h2>5. Links to Third-Party Sites</h2>
        <p>This website may contain links to third-party web sites or services that are not owned or controlled by M.P. Public School. We have no control over, and assume no responsibility for, the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third party web sites or services.</p>

        <h2>6. Online Fee Payment</h2>
        <p>If you use our online payment facility, you agree to provide accurate and complete information. All payments are subject to our refund and cancellation policy. M.P. Public School is not responsible for any transaction failures or errors caused by third-party payment gateways or banking networks.</p>

        <h2>7. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right, at our sole discretion, to modify or replace these Terms at any time. What constitutes a material change will be determined at our sole discretion.</p>

        <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us at:</p>
        <p>
          <strong>{siteConfig.name}</strong><br/>
          {siteConfig.address}<br/>
          Phone: {siteConfig.phones[0]}<br/>
          Email: <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
